CUE's struct shorthand on a version file's top-level fields: Schema and a
lens block are written with their braces. Beneath them the shorthand is
accepted and Format expands it (see shorthand-inside).
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: meta: {
	owner: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}

ForwardLens: v1_0: {
	meta: {
		team: "unassigned"
	}
}
-- out/error --
ForwardLens: v1_0: ... is CUE's struct shorthand; a version file writes ForwardLens with its braces: ForwardLens: {v1_0: ...}:
    1.0.thema:8:14
Schema: meta: ... is CUE's struct shorthand; a version file writes Schema with its braces: Schema: {meta: ...}:
    history/0.0.thema:1:9
